      "title": "Activists break into building site of Microsoft datacentre in Amsterdam",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/06/activists-break-into-building-site-of-microsoft-datacentre-in-amsterdam",
      "description": "<p>Separate actions also take place outside fence and across Europe in backlash against impact of AI boom</p><p>Activists have stormed the site of a Microsoft datacentre being built in Amsterdam, as the backlash to the social and environmental harms of the AI boom spreads across Europe.</p><p>Protesters from Geef Tegengas, a Dutch direct action group, clashed with police while breaking into a construction site at Westpoort, Amsterdam, where some members climbed a crane, lit flares and tied helium balloons to equipment.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/06/activists-break-into-building-site-of-microsoft-datacentre-in-amsterdam\">Continue reading...</a>",
